0..78 Comment "// A manifest model type: `Model(T) with sort x = A` is the type of the models"
79..157 Comment "// of `T` whose sort `x` is `A`, the record of `T`\'s other components with `x`"
158..235 Comment "// read as `A`, as `model-manifest.gandr`\'s ascription states it of a module."
236..314 Comment "// A chain, `with sort x = A with sort y = B`, fixes one sort per binding. The"
315..393 Comment "// type is a family in `A`, so two sharings whose types are equivalent are one"
394..472 Comment "// type along the equivalence, and a model of one is carried to a model of the"
473..548 Comment "// other: the structure identity principle at a fixed sort (the HoTT book\'s"
549..622 Comment "// § 2.14; cubical Agda\'s `Cubical/Foundations/SIP.agda`), after Leroy\'s"
623..699 Comment "// manifest types (_Manifest Types, Modules, and Separate Compilation_, POPL"
700..736 Comment "// 1994, doi:10.1145/174675.176926)."
738..784 Comment "// The counter: a carrier, a start and a step."
785..791 Keyword "import"
